<title>UK: Wheat bulker grounded on river Parana, Argentina.</title>
<headline>Wheat bulker grounded on river Parana, Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The St. Vincent and Grenadines-flagged bulker Anna A., loaded with approximately 18,500 tonnes  of wheat, ran aground on December 10 in the vicinity of km 551 on the river Parana, Argentina, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 23,521 dwt vessel had previously been at Santa Fe.</p>
